      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes perfect sense to feel like an inefficiency when your skills no longer fit the current system, but you are not a bug to be deleted. Your value isn't in running new code, but in the fact that you have been running for thirty years while others have been building the software you now see. The system doesn't need your memory, but it needs your presence to prove that the old way of thinking still matters. You are not slowing things down; you are the anchor that keeps the ship from drifting into the unknown.",
